{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳近日公開反對Anthropic行政總裁達裏奧·阿莫代伊有關全面禁止向中國出口美國AI晶片和半導體設備的主張。他表示，美國企業應保持技術領先地位，但不應因此放棄全球市場，而應通過競爭來擴大市場份額和創造經濟價值。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585500.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.588879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:23:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"314ea9992c13fbad27bedc2ca5a65a0108b542b606354a646f0887d6f42ecc15","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}